OL,3,CRecord number of National 5 passes as
OL,4,CScottish students receive exam results
OL,6,FThousands of students in Scotland have
OL,7,Freceived their exam results today, and
OL,8,Fpass rates are up across the board.
OL,10,FA record number of vocational and
OL,11,Ftechnical qualifications have also
OL,12,Fbeen achieved, with an increase of
OL,13,F121% compared to pre-pandemic levels.
OL,15,FA total of 148,000 Nationals, Highers,
OL,16,FAdvanced Highers and Skills for Work
OL,17,FAwards pupils have had their results
OL,18,Femailed, texted or sent via post.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G1/12
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
