OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F327A1786036715
OL,3,CRecord number of National 5 passes as
OL,4,CScottish students receive exam results
OL,6,FThis year marks the first time
OL,7,FScotland's new examinations body,
OL,8,FQualifications Scotland, has overseen
OL,9,Fexam results.
OL,11,FIts predecessor, the Scottish
OL,12,FQualifications Authority, was marked
OL,13,Ffor closure in 2021, but it took over
OL,14,Ffour years for the SQA to be replaced.
OL,16,FHow did Scottish students do in 2026?
OL,18,FNationwide, 2026 saw the second annual
OL,19,Fincrease in the pass rate for all
OL,20,Fthree graded national qualifications.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G2/12
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,328,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F327A1786036715
OL,3,CRecord number of National 5 passes as
OL,4,CScottish students receive exam results
OL,6,FNational 5 exams, which are
OL,7,Fapproximate to English GCSEs, saw a
OL,8,Fpass rate of 79.2%, up 0.8% from last
OL,9,Fyear.
OL,11,FHighers, which are similar to the old
OL,12,FAS-Level in that they are a one-year
OL,13,Fcourse, saw a pass rate of 76.7%, also
OL,14,Fup 0.8% on the previous year.
OL,16,FAdvanced Highers, which are equivalent
OL,17,Fto A-Levels, had a pass rate of 76.7%,
OL,18,Frepresenting an increase of 0.9% on
OL,19,F2025.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G3/12
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,328,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F327A1786036715
OL,3,CRecord number of National 5 passes as
OL,4,CScottish students receive exam results
OL,6,FThe results show a record number of
OL,7,F269,115 National 5 passes, with an
OL,8,Fincrease in Grade A awards.
OL,10,FAre there any other good results?
OL,12,FOver 120,000 vocational and technical
OL,13,Fqualification awards have been awarded
OL,14,Fthis year, a record high and a 9.1%
OL,15,Fincrease on 2026.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G4/12
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,328,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F327A1786036715
OL,3,CRecord number of National 5 passes as
OL,4,CScottish students receive exam results
OL,6,FThe Scottish Government says that the
OL,7,F'poverty related attainment gap for A-
OL,8,FC passes' has narrowed, with better
OL,9,Fresults recorded for both the most
OL,10,Fdeprived and least deprived areas of
OL,11,Fthe country.
OL,13,FThere has also been an increase in
OL,14,Fpass rates and the number of A grades
OL,15,Fawarded to learners with additional
OL,16,Fsupport needs across National 5 and
OL,17,FHighers.
OL,19,FInsight from ITV Border Political
OL,20,FEditor, Kieran Andrews
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G5/12
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
