PN,32706
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F327A1786036715
OL,3,CRecord number of National 5 passes as
OL,4,CScottish students receive exam results
OL,6,FIt's a sunny morning in a rural
OL,7,FScottish town and the postie is zig-
OL,8,Fzagging up the street towards my house.
OL,10,FNerves are high because it's exam
OL,11,Fresults day but it's not me who can't
OL,12,Ftake the stress any longer as one of
OL,13,Fmy parents strides down the road
OL,14,Fasking for the envelope containing my
OL,15,Fgrades.
OL,17,FI guess text messages take away the
OL,18,Fstress of waiting for the results to
OL,19,Farrive but this is still a big day for
OL,20,Fschool pupils.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G6/12
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,328,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32707
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F327A1786036715
OL,3,CRecord number of National 5 passes as
OL,4,CScottish students receive exam results
OL,6,FWithout straying too far into cliche,
OL,7,FI didn't get exactly what I wanted the
OL,8,Ffirst time round but things have still
OL,9,Fworked out pretty well so those who
OL,10,Fare disappointed today should keep
OL,11,Ftheir chins up because this is far
OL,12,Ffrom the end of the road.
OL,14,FThese results are first and foremost
OL,15,Fabout the pupils sitting them but
OL,16,FScotland's new qualifications
OL,17,Fauthority will have been worried about
OL,18,Fthem too.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G7/12
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,328,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32708
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F327A1786036715
OL,3,CRecord number of National 5 passes as
OL,4,CScottish students receive exam results
OL,6,FThis year was the first test of
OL,7,FQualifications Scotland following the
OL,8,Frebranding and shake up of the SQA
OL,9,Fthat was supposed to deliver big
OL,10,Fimprovements.
OL,12,FAnd what we've seen are improvements,
OL,13,Falthough they are modest.
OL,15,FThe results are better than last
OL,16,Fyear's and are generally back in the
OL,17,Fballpark of where they were pre-
OL,18,Fpandemic.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G8/12
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,328,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32709
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F327A1786036715
OL,3,CRecord number of National 5 passes as
OL,4,CScottish students receive exam results
OL,6,FMeanwhile the poverty-related
OL,7,Fattainment gap has also narrowed but
OL,8,Fonly very slightly and that big
OL,9,Fpromise made in 2015 by then First
OL,10,FMinister Nicola Sturgeon to "close the
OL,11,Fattainment gap completely" is still
OL,12,Fnowhere near being met.
OL,14,FNew Education Secretary Mairi McAllan
OL,15,Fwill also be pleased.
OL,17,FShe was only appointed during the exam
OL,18,Fperiod so gets no credit but you can
OL,19,Fbet she will be relieved she's not
OL,20,Fhaving to shoulder any blame either.
OL,26,@rD@]OUsD@ZO]
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G9/12
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,328,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32710
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F327A1786036715
OL,3,CRecord number of National 5 passes as
OL,4,CScottish students receive exam results
OL,6,FIndeed Ms McAllan, who is regularly
OL,7,Ftipped as a contender to succeed John
OL,8,FSwinney as first minister, can look at
OL,9,Fher predecessor Jenny Giltruth as
OL,10,Finspiration for this job being a
OL,11,Fspringboard to promotion.
OL,13,FLast year's exam results were cited as
OL,14,Fa reason for Ms Gilruth's elevation to
OL,15,Fdeputy first minister in May's
OL,16,Freshuffle proving that good grades in
OL,17,Flater life can sometimes be even more
OL,18,Fvaluable than those achieved at school.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                G10/12
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,328,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32711
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F327A1786036715
OL,3,CRecord number of National 5 passes as
OL,4,CScottish students receive exam results
OL,6,FThe Scottish Education Secretary,
OL,7,FMairi McAllan MSP said: "This is a
OL,8,Fproud day for Scotland's young people
OL,9,Fand our education system.
OL,11,F"My congratulations go to everyone
OL,12,Freceiving their results. I know how
OL,13,Fmuch hard work and resilience it takes
OL,14,Fto get here and you all deserve
OL,15,Fenormous credit.
OL,26,@oD@Bqp
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                G11/12
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,328,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32712
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F327A1786036715
OL,3,CRecord number of National 5 passes as
OL,4,CScottish students receive exam results
OL,6,F"These are incredibly positive results
OL,7,Facross the board, with academic passes
OL,8,Fup at every level ` National 5, Higher
OL,9,Fand Advanced Higher ` as well as
OL,10,Frecord numbers of vocational
OL,11,Fqualifications. This is testament to
OL,12,Fthe breadth and strength of Scotland's
OL,13,Feducation system, the professionalism
OL,14,Fof our teachers and school staff and
OL,15,Fthe hard work of our young people."
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                G12/12
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
